<title>USA: GPU Inc Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>GPU Inc Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.Y. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		   $ 0.67		   $ 0.59</p>
<p> Net		    80,653		   69,380</p>
<p> Revs		  924,678		 930,954</p>
<p> Avg shrs	    120,840		  117,318</p>
<p>				12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		    $ 2.47		  $ 3.79</p>
<p> Net		    298,352		   440,135</p>
<p> Revs		 3,918,089		 3,804,656</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     120,743		   116,214</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>First Call consensus estimate for fourth quarter earnings per share was $0.61 and for 1996 was $3.03.</p>
<p>Notes: Periods ended Dec 31. Earnings for 1996 include a charge to income of $74.5 million, or $0.62 per share, for costs related to voluntary enhanced retirement programs.</p>
<p>Earnings for 1995 include a credit to income of $104.9 million, or $0.91 per share, from the reversal of future TMI-2 retirement costs previously written off. Partially offsetting the effect of the increase was a write-off of $8.4 million, or $0.07 per share, for TMI-2 monitored storage costs.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
